# Come Play in May

Come Play in May another Rhythm Culture latest edition and we would have to say that this newsletter is absolutely the most exciting newsletter we have done....after days of arranging info, uploading photos, cups of tea and coffee, we are now ready to share all of our latest juice and we hope you enjoy it as much as we like clicking SEND NOW! :) So, to sum up there are competitions, photos, events, some fabulous articles on drumming and rhythm written by us on the drumming inside :) and a whole lot more including a big warm welcome to Tani Du Toi, who has now become so valuable to us that we are thinking on retiring or more realistically going on holiday! Ha! As the weather gets cooler and the classes continue, we hope to see more and more drummers joining up to keep their bodies warm and smiling for winter and no, we don't accept "it's too cold to drum" excuses. Especially this far north! So, on that note..enjoy the read and remember its always perfect to do something just for pure fun no matter how silly it may seem!...I'll leave it there. See you all soon!
